  "details": "# Ui Creators Support\n\nThis is not an original Idea but I wanted to shed some light on it and give a more in-depth view into this feature/ toolkit that this would introduce to Vrchat.\n\n# The idea\n\nVrchat creators currently can make worlds, avatars, and even now programs (through Osc). One of the areas of creativity neglected is the Ui, All Vrchat players have to use the Ui at some point during their play sessions and while the Ui has had massive improvements over the years I feel like we can make the experience of using it much better.\n\nWith **Ui 2.0** the Vrchat team added new backgrounds to the menu, which is good I feel like this can be taken much further. I wish we had control over the colors/ Icons on the menu and be able to change them.\n\n**Examples:** \n\n-*A Vrchat player making their menu a pink color scheme*\n\n`A color selection wheel can do this.`\n\n-*A Vrc group changing Icons of the menu to fit a particular style*\n\n`Edits the Images of the ui/ setting color theme`\n\n-*A Vrc+ user taking a photo of their friends and using it as a parallax menu background*  \n\n`Using the multi-layer camera and gallary`\n\n# Implementation\n\nThis could be done in two major ways:\n\n1. In the menu itself as a customization tab in the settings\n\n2. As its own Creator companion package\n\nThese two methods have their drawbacks. The first option is more restrictive on the user whereas the second option would be a \"Headache\" to implement (I would assume). \n\n# How can players Share menus??\n\nAn Idea I have could be to use either the creator economy (In the future) or the group system (For the current day). The creator economy could use this as a reward for subscribing to a creator or a product directly sold by a creator. On the other hand, Groups could use this feature which would be a great incentive to join more art-focused groups and can be used to fit a world's theme with the overall menu and Udon hooks.\n\n# Conclusion \n\nImplementing a form of Ui customization involving either simple color changes or more complex Icon replacements would be an amazing change that would allow users to Improve their personalization. Though the awkwardness of the Ui may make this a difficult task to implement, I believe this could be a worthy time investment for the Team!\n\n# Similar posts\n\nFeel free to merge these posts as they all are very similar.\n\n[Custom menu themes (By xana43)](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/custom-menu-themes)\n\n[Customizable UI (By Crimson_Gurei27)](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/customizable-ui)\n\n[Allow users to customize the default UI colors (By Rivera․)](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1236-allow-users-to-customize-the-default-ui-colors)",
